# Hunger Strikes (adoulin 76), the kinds: a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin with The Starving completed (a GM) and
# 125 Adoulin fame (level 3: his script offers Always More Quoth the Ravenous, 3010, on its turns). Westerly Breeze:
# 2530 (a progressEvent: it outranks his script), finished: begun; available again (a GM): 2530 again (an event would
# give his script this turn: 3010). Accepted: 2531 (an event: the accepted section registered under Western Adoulin,
# user ruling 2026-11-04, kept Lua bugs), then his script's turn: 3010, finished: Always More Quoth the Ravenous begun
# (his script).
lists WesternAdoulin/Westerly_Breeze/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2530
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=63.5,32,123 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Adoulin.TheStarving completed
fame Adoulin 125
login
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # available: 2530
finish                                  # begun
quest Adoulin.HungerStrikes available   # a GM
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # available: 2530 (a progressEvent, not his script's turn)
finish                                  # begun
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # accepted: 2531 (an event)
finish-if-event
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # his script's turn: 3010
finish                                  # Always More Quoth the Ravenous begun
